      "text": "1. observe: get the Pet\n     from the cache\n2. compute the mood from\n     lastFedAt, feedEvery, now\n3. act: CreateOrUpdate the card,\n     create or delete the Pod\n4. report: write status, return\n     RequeueAfter = time until\n     the mood changes",
